  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisite Region - Golden Road Whether you're a fascinated outsider
    or a local proud of your nation's storied past, you're a devoted student of Osirion's
    history. You might be a traveling professor, a member of a society like the Pathfinders
    or the Esoteric Order of the Palatine Eye, or even a simple tomb robber cashing
    in on the glories of the past. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution
    or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Occultism
    skill and the Ancient Osirion Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Oddity
    Identification] skill feat.
